import{_ as t,o as n,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Overview of the Technological System","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/60-技术体系总览.md","filePath":"en/60-技术体系总览.md","lastUpdated":1789183869000}'),a={name:"en/60-技术体系总览.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,d){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="overview-of-the-technological-system" tabindex="-1">Overview of the Technological System <a class="header-anchor" href="#overview-of-the-technological-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Overview of the Technological System&quot;">​</a></h1><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Document No.</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>Module</td><td>Technology and Energy Systems</td></tr><tr><td>Core Keywords</td><td>Technological system, law engineering, reality as foundation, law-driven upgrading, four stages</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="i-the-fundamental-stance-of-the-technological-system" tabindex="-1">I. The Fundamental Stance of the Technological System <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-fundamental-stance-of-the-technological-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Fundamental Stance of the Technological System&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The technological system of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization is built upon the fundamental principle of &quot;reality as foundation, law-driven upgrading&quot;. This principle contains two layers of meaning: first, the real world is the only true world; all technological inventions must be based on the physical laws of reality and may not fabricate devices that violate the basic laws of conservation out of thin air. Second, when needs arise in domains that real-world technology has not yet reached, logically consistent upgrading and deduction based on existing laws is permitted, converting mechanisms already verified within the cultivation laws into technological solutions that can be engineered and implemented.</p><p>The technological system of the Hengyuan Universe is not the traditional binary opposition between &quot;technology&quot; and &quot;cultivation&quot;, but rather a &quot;law engineering&quot; system in which the two are deeply integrated. Cultivators&#39; understanding of the origin laws provides the theoretical frontier for technology, while engineering technology converts law understanding into infrastructure that can be mass-produced and popularized. This integration means technological progress no longer depends on the accidental discoveries of a few geniuses, but is built upon the collective evolution driven by the continuous feedback of the Anchor network.</p><h2 id="ii-the-layered-architecture-of-the-technological-system" tabindex="-1">II. The Layered Architecture of the Technological System <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-layered-architecture-of-the-technological-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Layered Architecture of the Technological System&quot;">​</a></h2><p>According to the depth of coupling with the origin laws, the technological system of the Hengyuan Universe is divided into four layers:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>Name</th><th>Characteristics</th><th>Representative Technologies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>First Layer</td><td>Reality Technology Layer</td><td>Based on classical physics and modern science, not involving cultivation laws</td><td>Electric power, electronics, computing, aerospace</td></tr><tr><td>Second Layer</td><td>Law Empowerment Layer</td><td>Embeds cultivation law mechanisms into existing technology, achieving leaps in performance</td><td>Multiplication Fruit deduction engine, energy standardization and metering</td></tr><tr><td>Third Layer</td><td>Law Engineering Layer</td><td>Takes the origin laws directly as engineering objects, constructing an entirely new technological paradigm</td><td>Spatial legal principle dispatch devices, Replication Mirror systems, isolated spaces</td></tr><tr><td>Fourth Layer</td><td>Anchor Infrastructure Layer</td><td>The cross-plane, cross-tier technological foundation centered on the Anchor</td><td>Anchor hardware arrays, cross-plane communication networks, symbiotic feedback systems</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The four layers are not a replacement relationship but a stacking relationship. The Reality Technology Layer is the material foundation of all upper-layer technologies, the Law Empowerment Layer is the transitional bridge, the Law Engineering Layer is the technological core of the symbiotic civilization, and the Anchor Infrastructure Layer is the fundamental guarantee of civilizational ascension. The research and development of any new technology must be verified layer by layer from the bottom up, and it is forbidden to skip the reality foundation and directly construct high-level technology.</p><h2 id="iii-the-basic-process-of-technological-research-and-development" tabindex="-1">III. The Basic Process of Technological Research and Development <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-basic-process-of-technological-research-and-development" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Basic Process of Technological Research and Development&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Technological research and development in the Hengyuan Universe follows the five-step process of &quot;law understanding → mechanism verification → engineering prototype → standardized mass production → open sharing&quot;:</p><ol><li><strong>Law understanding</strong>: Cultivators and researchers jointly conduct deep deduction on the target law, completing theoretical modeling with the aid of the Multiplication Fruit deduction engine.</li><li><strong>Mechanism verification</strong>: Conduct small-scale experiments in isolated spaces to verify the reproducibility and boundary conditions of the law mechanism.</li><li><strong>Engineering prototype</strong>: Build an operable engineering prototype machine, testing stability, energy consumption, and safety.</li><li><strong>Standardized mass production</strong>: Determine technical parameters through the energy standardization and metering system, establishing mass production processes.</li><li><strong>Open sharing</strong>: According to the technology openness and sharing mechanism, open mature technologies to the entire civilization.</li></ol><p>The core characteristic of this process is &quot;low-pollution verification&quot;. All experiments involving unknown laws must be conducted in isolated spaces, and experimental results are only transmitted back in the form of knowledge, ensuring that no uncontrollable law pollution is caused to the main plane.</p><h2 id="iv-the-correspondence-between-the-technological-system-and-the-four-stage-ascension-path" tabindex="-1">IV. The Correspondence between the Technological System and the Four-Stage Ascension Path <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-correspondence-between-the-technological-system-and-the-four-stage-ascension-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Correspondence between the Technological System and the Four-Stage Ascension Path&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The development of the technological system corresponds strictly to the four-stage ascension path:</p><ul><li><strong>Reality Foundation Stage</strong>: Dominated by the Reality Technology Layer, focusing on improving infrastructure such as energy, communications, and transportation, eliminating technological monopoly and the digital divide.</li><li><strong>Technology Empowerment Stage</strong>: The Law Empowerment Layer unfolds comprehensively; technologies such as the Multiplication Fruit deduction engine greatly improve scientific research efficiency, and the energy standardization system is established.</li><li><strong>Consciousness Evolution Stage</strong>: The Law Engineering Layer matures; technologies such as spatial legal principle dispatch, the Replication Mirror, and isolated spaces are popularized, and consciousness-domain interface technology achieves breakthroughs.</li><li><strong>Interstellar Symbiosis Stage</strong>: The Anchor Infrastructure Layer covers the cross-plane network, and interstellar-level energy dispatch and communication systems are completed.</li></ul><p>Currently, the Hengyuan Universe is at the critical period of transition from Reality Foundation to Technology Empowerment, with multiple core technologies of the Law Empowerment Layer moving from the laboratory toward mass production.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The overview of the technological system is the entry point for understanding the material foundation of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization. It is neither a simple repetition of real-world technology nor a random piling up of fantasy laws, but a complete technological paradigm with &quot;reality as foundation, law-driven upgrading&quot; as its principle, law engineering as its core, and four-stage ascension as its path. The subsequent documents will elaborate on specific technological fields.</p><h2 id="related-documents" tabindex="-1">Related Documents <a class="header-anchor" href="#related-documents" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related Documents&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>61-倍增果实工程化应用 (Engineering Applications of the Multiplication Fruit)</li><li>62-空间法理技术实现 (Technological Implementation of Spatial Legal Principle Dispatch)</li><li>67-锚点硬件与基础设施 (Anchor Hardware and Infrastructure)</li></ul>',21)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{u as __pageData,p as default};
